  {
   "id": 317277,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Marisa’s credit card charges 8.9% annual interest. Her current billing period is from September 1 to September 30. The balance on September 1 was $384.25. Use Marisa’s following transactions to determine her balance due at the end of the billing cycle.<br>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\" summary=\".\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Date</th>\n<th>Activity</th>\n<th>Amount</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1-Sep</td>\n<td> Billing Date Balance</td>\n<td>$384.25</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2-Sep</td>\n<td>Food</td>\n<td>$94.54</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5-Sep</td>\n<td>Gasoline</td>\n<td>$25.65</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5-Sep</td>\n<td>Internet</td>\n<td>$39.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9-Sep</td>\n<td>Insurance</td>\n<td>$174.52</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16-Sep</td>\n<td>Food</td>\n<td>$83.54</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16-Sep</td>\n<td>Day Care</td>\n<td>$350.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20-Sep</td>\n<td>Tires</td>\n<td>$2,337.56</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21-Sep</td>\n<td>Child Clothing</td>\n<td>$27.65</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21-Sep</td>\n<td>Gasoline</td>\n<td>$31.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>28-Sep</td>\n<td>Television</td>\n<td>$299.95</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
